# Telemetry API Alignment Fixes
## 1. API Contract Updates ([AuthApiService.kt](cci:7://file:///Users/vivekgupta/workspace/collect/aiims-auth-module/src/main/java/org/aiims/odk/auth/api/AuthApiService.kt:0:0-0:0))
Updated [TelemetryRequest](cci:2://file:///Users/vivekgupta/workspace/collect/aiims-auth-module/src/main/java/org/aiims/odk/auth/api/AuthApiService.kt:69:0-75:1) to support nullable locations and added the `TelemetryEvent` data class.
```kotlin
// Updated Request Model
data class TelemetryRequest(
    val deviceId: String,
    val collectVersion: String,
    val deviceDateTime: String,
    val location: TelemetryLocation?,        // [CHANGED] Now Nullable
    val events: List<TelemetryEvent>? = null // [NEW] Added Events support
)
// [NEW] Added Event Model
data class TelemetryEvent(
    val id: String,
    val type: String,
    val timestamp: String,
    val payload: Map<String, String>? = null
)



## 2. Manager Logic Updates (
AiimsAuthManager.kt
)
Updated submitTelemetry to handle optional events and null locations, and added a unique ID generator.

```kt
class AiimsAuthManager ... {

    companion object {
        // ... existing constants ...

        // [NEW] Helper for stable deduplication IDs
        fun generateEventId(): String {
            return java.util.UUID.randomUUID().toString()
        }
    }

    // [CHANGED] Updated signature to accept optional event
    suspend fun submitTelemetry(location: android.location.Location?, event: TelemetryEvent? = null) {
        // ... (preamble) ...

        // [CHANGED] Handle null location properly (previously passed dummy 0.0, 0.0)
        val telemetryLocation = if (location != null) {
            TelemetryLocation(
                latitude = location.latitude,
                longitude = location.longitude,
                // ... map other fields ...
            )
        } else {
            null // Send null to backend instead of fake location
        }

        val request = TelemetryRequest(
            // ... deviceId, version ...
            location = telemetryLocation,
            events = if (event != null) listOf(event) else null // [NEW] Wrap single event in list
        )

        // ... submit request ...
    }
}
```

